# Web React

- Anonymous session: create on load; send `X-Session-Token`.
- Render SSE `token` stream; show `model_id` on assistant bubbles.
- Prefer relative `/api` in Docker; `VITE_API_URL` only for direct local API.
- Keep UI copy domain-agnostic.
